{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little man suffers from a rare cubic disease that takes away his eyesight while moving, now he is trying to return home, but a terrible disaster and an aggressive environment prevent him, will he be able to return back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color Madness</strong> is a side-view game where the player controls a cube that loses its eyesight when moving and moves from memory, dodging traps and overcoming various obstacles, jumping on platforms and avoiding collisions with dangerous cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD - moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Difficulty</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete 1 World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460190/baaa72afdc6be1d23f8e90d468318f95677fd90a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 2 World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460190/e9ce3f84b98c2dd644f7a51e1e16653541d28efd.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 3 World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460190/57257ffc32685fa80cf07f16b6a4d6d871973d95.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 4 World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460190/dcdfbf9833510ab854b7133d0bf9f566ce7c6bc2.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 5 World!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460190/b4d70c7378d6d8cbafdeb89a9e609ba84778cb0f.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460190?t=1741050556","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/34